2.  Report Bullying: Users can report instances of cyberbullying using the app's reporting feature.
3.  Moderation System: A team of moderators will review and approve or deny reports, ensuring that the platform remains safe and respectful.
4.  Reputation System: Users can view their reputation score based on the number of reports they've received and the frequency of online interactions.
5.  Social Sharing: Users can share reports on social media to help prevent bullying in their communities.
6.  Chat Functionality: Users can communicate with each other through a private messaging system.
7.  Notification System: Users receive notifications when someone posts a threatening or harassing message.

