1. **Cyberbullying Report**: Users can report incidents of cyberbullying.
2. **Recipient Community**: Users can join a community (group) of those who have experienced cyberbullying.
3. **Cyberbullying Support**: Company founded team will be able to provide assistance, guidance, and resources to those who have been cyberbullied.
4. **Discipline and Moderation**: Automated system that applies penalties, bans, or restrictions on users who have engaged in cyberbullying tactics.

